Prior art (no code used)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following projects were surveyed while designing svg-grid-builder. No code
was taken from them. They are listed because they shaped the design decisions
behind this tool, and because their authors deserve the credit for exploring
this space first.

    svg-pixel-editor, by TheRealSmeddy
    MIT License.
    A lightweight browser-based pixel art editor that exports SVG. The closest
    existing tool to this one.

    pixel-forge, by BataJini
    MIT License.
    A far more ambitious fully client-side pixel-art editor with layers,
    animation frames, palettes, and PNG/SVG/GIF/spritesheet export.

    Widget-Pixel-Art-Editor, by XerVth
    ISC License.
    A similar pixel-art-to-SVG editor, packaged as an Electron desktop
    application rather than a single web page.

